# Info Server SPA build output (E44S01 — AC5/AC9b):
# vvwt-info-client writes its Vite outDir directly into vvwt-info-server/src/main/resources/static/info/
# with emptyOutDir: true, which wipes the entire directory on every npm run build.
# Gitignoring this directory prevents committed build-output residue after each rebuild.
# This is the mechanical primary gate per DEC-42 internet-facing posture (C-7).
vvwt-info-server/src/main/resources/static/info/
